From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luca <lucadiasferreira@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 16:22:10 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Corrige caminho do projeto no CI

O merge renomeou o projeto para Loro.xcodeproj, mas o workflow ainda
referenciava Papagaio.xcodeproj. O xcodebuild não encontrava o projeto.
---
 .github/workflows/ci.yml | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/ci.yml b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
--- a/.github/workflows/ci.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
@@ -21,7 +21,7 @@
         run: swift test
 
   build-app:
-    name: Build do app (Papagaio.xcodeproj)
+    name: Build do app (Loro.xcodeproj)
     runs-on: macos-26
     steps:
       - uses: actions/checkout@v4
@@ -32,7 +32,7 @@
       - name: xcodebuild build
         run: |
           xcodebuild build \
-            -project Papagaio.xcodeproj \
+            -project Loro.xcodeproj \
             -scheme Papagaio \
             -destination 'generic/platform=macOS' \
             -skipPackagePluginValidation \
-- 
